<body>
    <h1>1. FSR Pipeline - Scraping + Chunking =E2=80=93 Design</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <p class=3D"code-line">This document describes the two core process=
es that together form the FSR (Field Service Report) data pipeline:</p>
<ol class=3D"code-line">
 <li class=3D"code-line" data-uuid=3D"72d2cbcf-d3e3-406b-9fc9-23ad783b5c7f"=
><strong>Process 1 =E2=80=93 Scraping &amp; Metadata Extraction (Silver)</s=
trong></li>
 <li class=3D"code-line" data-uuid=3D"f062a456-9522-4966-981f-e824d7d6b85c"=
><strong>Process 2 =E2=80=93 Chunking &amp; Vector Embedding (Gold)</strong=
></li>
</ol>
<p class=3D"code-line">Both processes run on Databricks and operate on the =
same set of PDF source volumes.</p>
<hr class=3D"code-line">
<h2 class=3D"code-line" id=3D"id-1.FSRPipelineScraping+Chunking=E2=80=93Des=
ign-ArchitectureOverview">Architecture Overview</h2>
<p><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manu=
al-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image confluence-content-image-b=
order" draggable=3D"false" height=3D"389" width=3D"468" src=3D"b44a3bfe4e41=
ba8bb2e4c7177044ecc6ba9b10c793b2045bda12b9dbf9437321" data-image-src=3D"/de=
vspace/download/attachments/358844652/image-2026-4-20_20-9-0.png?version=3D=
1&amp;modificationDate=3D1776740940557&amp;api=3Dv2" data-unresolved-commen=
t-count=3D"0" data-linked-resource-id=3D"358845435" data-linked-resource-ve=
rsion=3D"1" data-linked-resource-type=3D"attachment" data-linked-resource-d=
efault-alias=3D"image-2026-4-20_20-9-0.png" data-base-url=3D"https://conflu=
ence.apps.gevernova.net/devspace" data-linked-resource-content-type=3D"imag=
e/png" data-linked-resource-container-id=3D"358844652" data-linked-resource=
-container-version=3D"27" tabindex=3D"0" alt=3D""></span></p>
<h2 class=3D"code-line" id=3D"id-1.FSRPipelineScraping+Chunking=E2=80=93Des=
ign-Process1=E2=80=93Scraping&amp;MetadataExtraction">Process 1 =E2=80=93 S=
craping &amp; Metadata Extraction</h2>
<h3 class=3D"code-line" id=3D"id-1.FSRPipelineScraping+Chunking=E2=80=93Des=
ign-Purpose">Purpose</h3>
<p class=3D"code-line">Scan FSR PDF files from Unity Catalog volumes, extra=
ct structured metadata fields from each PDF, normalise them using an LLM, e=
nrich with IBAT / Event Vision lookup tables, and write the results to a ta=
ble.</p>
<h3 class=3D"code-line" id=3D"id-1.FSRPipelineScraping+Chunking=E2=80=93Des=
ign-Input">Input</h3>
<h4 class=3D"code-line" id=3D"id-1.FSRPipelineScraping+Chunking=E2=80=93Des=
ign-SourceVolumes">Source Volumes</h4>
<p class=3D"code-line">Files are read non-recursively from the following Un=
ity Catalog volume paths:</p>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
 <table class=3D"wrapped confluenceTable">
  <thead class=3D"">
   <tr class=3D"">
    <th style=3D"text-align: left;" class=3D"confluenceTh">#</th>
    <th style=3D"text-align: left;" class=3D"confluenceTh">Volume Path</th>
    <th style=3D"text-align: left;" class=3D"confluenceTh">Catalog</th>
   </tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody class=3D"">
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">1</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><code>/Volumes/viud/ing_ud_fsr_manual/manual=
_field_service_report/ecrt_reports</code></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><code>viud</code></td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">2</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><code>/Volumes/viud/ing_ud_fieldvision/fv_fi=
eld_service_report</code></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><code>viud</code></td>
   </tr>
  </tbody>
 </table>
</div>
<h4 class=3D"code-line" id=3D"id-1.FSRPipelineScraping+Chunking=E2=80=93Des=
ign-FileTypes">File Types</h4>
<ul class=3D"code-line">
 <li class=3D"code-line" data-uuid=3D"fd27ef96-fed9-431f-9d37-a9af4adba8b5"=
><strong>Accepted:</strong><span>&nbsp;</span><code>.pdf</code><span>&nbsp;=
</span>files at the top level of each volume path</li>
 <li class=3D"code-line" data-uuid=3D"45257032-913d-41ba-a0dc-d5cff12ea024"=
><strong>Skipped:</strong><span>&nbsp;</span><code>.crdownload</code>,<span=
>&nbsp;</span><code>.tmp</code>,<span>&nbsp;</span><code>.part</code>,<span=
>&nbsp;</span><code>.download</code>,<span>&nbsp;</span><code>.DS_Store</co=
de>,<span>&nbsp;</span><code>.json</code>,<span>&nbsp;</span><code>.txt</co=
de>,<span>&nbsp;</span><code>.csv</code>,<span>&nbsp;</span><code>.xlsx</co=
de>, and any sub-directories</li>
</ul>
<h4 class=3D"code-line" id=3D"id-1.FSRPipelineScraping+Chunking=E2=80=93Des=
ign-Lookup/EnrichmentSources">Lookup / Enrichment Sources</h4>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
 <table class=3D"wrapped confluenceTable">
  <thead class=3D"">
   <tr class=3D"">
    <th style=3D"text-align: left;" class=3D"confluenceTh">Source</th>
    <th style=3D"text-align: left;" class=3D"confluenceTh">Default Location=
</th>
    <th style=3D"text-align: left;" class=3D"confluenceTh">Purpose</th>
   </tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody class=3D"">
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">IBAT Equipment</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><code>vgpp.prm_std_views.ibat_equipment_mst<=
/code></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">ESN / equipment type enrichment</td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Event Vision SOT</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><code>vgpp.fsr_std_views.eventmgmt_event_vis=
ion_sot</code></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Event / project ID enrichment</td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">FSR PDF Reference</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><code>vgpp.fsr_std_views.fsr_pdf_ref</code><=
/td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Resolve human-readable<span>&nbsp;</span><co=
de>pdf_name</code><span>&nbsp;</span>from<span>&nbsp;</span><code>document_=
id -&gt; s3_filename</code></td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">PSOT</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><code>vgpp.fsr_std_views.fsr_field_vision_fi=
eld_services_report_psot</code></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Resolve<span>&nbsp;</span><code>outage_type<=
/code><span>&nbsp;</span>and<span>&nbsp;</span><code>technology_type</code>=
<span>&nbsp;</span>via<span>&nbsp;</span><code>ev_equipment_event_id</code>=
</td>
   </tr>
  </tbody>
 </table>
</div>
<h3 class=3D"code-line" id=3D"id-1.FSRPipelineScraping+Chunking=E2=80=93Des=
ign-ProcessingSteps(high-level)">Processing Steps (high-level)</h3>
<p class=3D"code-line"><strong>Step 1 =E2=80=93 Discovery</strong></p>
<ol class=3D"code-line">
 <li class=3D"code-line" data-uuid=3D"055dca2a-cf6b-45e3-942a-33084ec6e9fc"=
>Scan volumes via<span>&nbsp;</span><code><a href=3D"http://dbutils.fs.ls" =
class=3D"external-link" rel=3D"nofollow">dbutils.fs.ls</a></code></li>
 <li class=3D"code-line" data-uuid=3D"7dfe83bf-2534-4ce4-86e1-c3c69f2acc33"=
>Compare discovered paths against<span>&nbsp;</span><code>volume_path</code=
><span>&nbsp;</span>in the output table</li>
 <li class=3D"code-line" data-uuid=3D"8c945301-cba9-4564-84fe-464da2ffab92"=
>Insert stub rows for new files with<span>&nbsp;</span><code>metadata_statu=
s =3D 'pending'</code>; reset<span>&nbsp;</span><code>metadata_status =3D '=
pending'</code><span>&nbsp;</span>for re-uploaded files (changed<span>&nbsp=
;</span><code>file_last_modified</code>)</li>
</ol>
<p class=3D"code-line"><strong>Step 2 =E2=80=93 PDF Extraction</strong><spa=
n>&nbsp;</span></p>
<ol>
 <li class=3D"code-line" data-uuid=3D"3051a1fa-f042-4dfd-9e14-54ffe673d641"=
>Query output table:<span>&nbsp;</span><code>WHERE metadata_status =3D 'pen=
ding' OR metadata_status =3D 'failed'</code><span>&nbsp;</span></li>
 <li class=3D"code-line" data-uuid=3D"098e0c38-3694-4c9e-b054-a8b06568f8da"=
>Extract key-value fields and title from page 1 of each PDF (<code>pdfplumb=
er</code>)</li>
 <li class=3D"code-line" data-uuid=3D"998d47ab-05b3-437d-a358-d60a5747d891"=
>Capture<span>&nbsp;</span><code>page_count</code>,<span>&nbsp;</span><code=
>file_size_bytes</code>,<span>&nbsp;</span><code>file_last_modified</code><=
span>&nbsp;</span>from the volume listing entry</li>
</ol>
<p class=3D"code-line"><strong>Step 3 =E2=80=93 LLM Normalisation</strong><=
span> </span></p>
<ol>
 <li class=3D"code-line" data-uuid=3D"9256b1d7-f96c-4684-a11d-c22a83f5e9f7"=
>Send page 1 extracted text to LLM for field normalisation (model:<span>&nb=
sp;</span><code>gemini-3-flash</code><span>&nbsp;</span>by default) =E2=80=
=94 produces<span>&nbsp;</span><code>title</code>,<span>&nbsp;</span><code>=
customer</code>,<span>&nbsp;</span><code>esn</code>,<span>&nbsp;</span><cod=
e>equipment_sys_id</code>,<span>&nbsp;</span><code>event_type</code>,<span>=
&nbsp;</span><code>ev_project_id</code>,<span>&nbsp;</span><code>ev_equipme=
nt_event_id</code>,<span>&nbsp;</span><code>ofs_event_id</code>,<span>&nbsp=
;</span><code>fsp_project_id</code>,<span>&nbsp;</span><code>xxx_project_id=
</code>,<span>&nbsp;</span><code>fsr_number</code>,<span>&nbsp;</span><code=
>report_issued_date</code>,<span>&nbsp;</span><code>outage_start_date</code=
>,<span>&nbsp;</span><code>outage_end_date</code>,<span>&nbsp;</span><code>=
prepared_by</code>,<span>&nbsp;</span><code>approved_by</code></li>
</ol>
<p class=3D"code-line"><strong>Step 4 =E2=80=93 Enrichment</strong><span> <=
/span></p>
<ol>
 <li class=3D"code-line" data-uuid=3D"eff12390-e5ed-4285-9170-e52c007d7219"=
><strong>IBAT</strong><span>&nbsp;</span>(<code>ibat_equipment_mst</code>):=
 match on<span>&nbsp;</span><code>equipment_sys_id</code><span>&nbsp;</span=
>or<span>&nbsp;</span><code>esn</code><span>&nbsp;</span>=E2=86=92 fill<spa=
n>&nbsp;</span><code>equipment_type</code>,<span>&nbsp;</span><code>equipme=
nt_class_code</code>; backfill<span>&nbsp;</span><code>esn</code><span>&nbs=
p;</span>/<span>&nbsp;</span><code>equipment_sys_id</code><span>&nbsp;</spa=
n>if blank; set<span>&nbsp;</span><code>esn_source =3D 'ibat'</code><span>&=
nbsp;</span>if ESN was resolved here.</li>
 <li class=3D"code-line" data-uuid=3D"d0bf92d3-b808-4304-bc42-7620d9a24b95"=
><strong>Event Vision SOT</strong><span>&nbsp;</span>(<code>eventmgmt_event=
_vision_sot</code>): match on<span>&nbsp;</span><code>ev_project_id</code><=
span>&nbsp;</span>/<span>&nbsp;</span><code>ev_equipment_event_id</code><sp=
an>&nbsp;</span>/<span>&nbsp;</span><code>ofs_event_id</code><span>&nbsp;</=
span>/<span>&nbsp;</span><code>fsp_project_id</code><span>&nbsp;</span>=E2=
=86=92 backfill any blank event/project ID fields and<span>&nbsp;</span><co=
de>event_type.</code></li>
 <li class=3D"code-line" data-uuid=3D"fab9a6c9-5270-49f4-bee1-02e6f3b231df"=
><strong>FSR PDF Reference</strong><span>&nbsp;</span>(<code>fsr_pdf_ref</c=
ode>): match<span>&nbsp;</span><code>document_id</code><span>&nbsp;</span>=
=E2=86=92<span>&nbsp;</span><code>s3_filename</code><span>&nbsp;</span>=E2=
=86=92 resolve human-readable<span>&nbsp;</span><code>pdf_name.</code></li>
 <li class=3D"code-line" data-uuid=3D"4d218308-a140-4e7d-a113-d8322836710c"=
><strong>PSOT</strong><span>&nbsp;</span>(<code>psot</code>): match<span>&n=
bsp;</span><code>ev_equipment_event_id</code><span>&nbsp;</span>=E2=86=92 r=
esolve<span>&nbsp;</span><code>outage_type</code><span>&nbsp;</span>and<spa=
n>&nbsp;</span><code>technology_type</code></li>
</ol>
<p class=3D"code-line"><strong>Step 5 =E2=80=93 Write</strong><span>&nbsp;<=
/span>13. Update the output table row in-place with all extracted and enric=
hed fields:</p>
<ul class=3D"code-line">
 <li class=3D"code-line" data-uuid=3D"357086d8-0b02-4e1a-a255-e0267145e2a4"=
><strong>On success</strong><span>&nbsp;</span>=E2=86=92 set<span>&nbsp;</s=
pan><code>metadata_status =3D 'completed'</code>,<span>&nbsp;</span><code>s=
craped_at =3D current_timestamp()</code></li>
 <li class=3D"code-line" data-uuid=3D"e873cf03-27b2-4cb8-abd1-56eb0ff6704f"=
><strong>On failure</strong><span>&nbsp;</span>=E2=86=92 set<span>&nbsp;</s=
pan><code>metadata_status =3D 'failed'</code>,<span>&nbsp;</span><code>meta=
data_error =3D &lt;message&gt;</code>,<span>&nbsp;</span><code>scraped_at =
=3D current_timestamp()</code></li>
</ul>
<blockquote class=3D"code-line">
 <p class=3D"code-line"><strong><code>FORCE_RESET</code><span>&nbsp;</span>=
override:</strong><span>&nbsp;</span>Setting<span>&nbsp;</span><code>FORCE_=
RESET =3D true</code><span>&nbsp;</span>truncates the output table and re-s=
cans all files from scratch.</p>
</blockquote>
<h3 class=3D"code-line" id=3D"id-1.FSRPipelineScraping+Chunking=E2=80=93Des=
ign-Output">Output</h3>
<h4 class=3D"code-line" id=3D"id-1.FSRPipelineScraping+Chunking=E2=80=93Des=
ign-OutputTable">Output Table</h4>
<p class=3D"code-line"><code>vaid/vaiq/vaip.ai_sot_field_service_report.biz=
_metadata_field_service_report</code></p>
<h4 class=3D"code-line" id=3D"id-1.FSRPipelineScraping+Chunking=E2=80=93Des=
ign-Schema">Schema</h4>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
 <table class=3D"wrapped confluenceTable">
  <thead class=3D"">
   <tr class=3D"">
    <th style=3D"text-align: left;" class=3D"confluenceTh">Column</th>
    <th style=3D"text-align: left;" class=3D"confluenceTh">Type</th>
    <th style=3D"text-align: left;" class=3D"confluenceTh">Description</th>
   </tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody class=3D"">
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><code>document_id</code></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">STRING NOT NULL</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><strong>Primary key.</strong><span>&nbsp;</s=
pan>UUID filename stem of the source PDF =E2=80=94 also the<span>&nbsp;</sp=
an><code>s3_filename</code><span>&nbsp;</span>value in<span>&nbsp;</span><c=
ode>fsr_pdf_ref</code></td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><code>pdf_name</code></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">STRING</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Human-readable PDF name =E2=80=94 resolved f=
rom<span>&nbsp;</span><code>fsr_pdf_ref</code><span>&nbsp;</span>by matchin=
g<span>&nbsp;</span><code>document_id</code><span>&nbsp;</span>to<span>&nbs=
p;</span><code>s3_fimename</code><span>&nbsp;</span>and picking =E2=86=92<s=
pan>&nbsp;</span><code>pdf_name</code></td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><code>volume_path</code></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">STRING NOT NULL</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Full<span>&nbsp;</span><code>/Volumes/...</c=
ode><span>&nbsp;</span>path to the source PDF</td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><code>title</code></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">STRING</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Report title extracted from the PDF</td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><code>customer</code></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">STRING</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Customer / site name</td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><code>esn</code></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">STRING</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Equipment Serial Number (resolved via preced=
ence)</td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><code>esn_source</code></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">STRING</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">How ESN was resolved:<span>&nbsp;</span><cod=
e>llm</code><span>&nbsp;</span>/<span>&nbsp;</span><code>ibat</code><span>&=
nbsp;</span>/<span>&nbsp;</span><code>null</code></td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><code>equipment_sys_id</code></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">STRING</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">System ID from IBAT</td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><code>equipment_type</code></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">STRING</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Equipment type (e.g. Generator, Gas Turbine)=
</td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><code>equipment_class_code</code></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">STRING</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Equipment sub-class / code</td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><code>event_type</code></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">STRING</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Event type (e.g. Call-Out, Inspection)</td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><code>ev_project_id</code></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">STRING</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Event Vision project ID</td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><code>ev_equipment_event_id</code></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">STRING</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Event Vision equipment event ID</td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><code>ofs_event_id</code></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">STRING</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">OFS event ID</td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><code>fsp_project_id</code></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">STRING</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">FSP project ID</td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><code>xxx_project_id</code></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">STRING</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Additional project ID (pipe-separated if mul=
tiple)</td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><code>fsr_number</code></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">STRING</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">FSR document number</td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><code>report_issued_date</code></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">STRING</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Date the FSR was issued =E2=80=94<span>&nbsp=
;</span><strong>format: YYYY-MM-DD</strong></td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><code>outage_start_date</code></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">STRING</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Outage start date =E2=80=94<span>&nbsp;</spa=
n><strong>format: YYYY-MM-DD</strong></td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><code>outage_end_date</code></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">STRING</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Outage end date =E2=80=94<span>&nbsp;</span>=
<strong>format: YYYY-MM-DD</strong></td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><code>outage_type</code></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">STRING</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Outage type =E2=80=94 resolved from PSOT tab=
le via<span>&nbsp;</span><code>ev_equipment_event_id</code></td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><code>technology_type</code></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">STRING</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Technology type =E2=80=94 resolved from PSOT=
 table via<span>&nbsp;</span><code>ev_equipment_event_id</code></td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><code>prepared_by</code></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">STRING</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Name of the person who prepared the report</=
td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><code>approved_by</code></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">STRING</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Name of the person who approved the report</=
td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><code>document_summary</code></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">STRING</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">LLM-generated full-document summary (3=E2=80=
=935 sentences)</td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><code>page_count</code></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">INT</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Number of pages in the PDF</td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><code>file_size_bytes</code></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">LONG</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">File size in bytes</td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><code>file_last_modified</code></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">TIMESTAMP</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Last modified timestamp from volume listing<=
/td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><code>metadata_status</code></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">STRING NOT NULL</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Scraping status:<span>&nbsp;</span><code>pen=
ding</code><span>&nbsp;</span>/<span>&nbsp;</span><code>completed</code><sp=
an>&nbsp;</span>/<span>&nbsp;</span><code>failed</code></td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><code>metadata_error</code></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">STRING</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Error message if metadata extraction failed<=
/td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><code>chunk_status</code></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">STRING NOT NULL</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Chunking status:<span>&nbsp;</span><code>pen=
ding</code><span>&nbsp;</span>/<span>&nbsp;</span><code>completed</code><sp=
an>&nbsp;</span>/<span>&nbsp;</span><code>failed</code></td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><code>chunk_error</code></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">STRING</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Error message if chunking failed</td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><code>ingested_at</code></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">TIMESTAMP</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">When this row was first created (file discov=
ery)</td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><code>scraped_at</code></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">TIMESTAMP</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">When metadata scraping last completed or fai=
led</td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><code>chunked_at</code></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">TIMESTAMP</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">When chunking last completed or failed</td>
   </tr>
  </tbody>
 </table>
</div>
<blockquote class=3D"code-line">
 <p class=3D"code-line"><strong>Date format:</strong><span>&nbsp;</span>All=
 date columns must be normalised to<span>&nbsp;</span><code>YYYY-MM-DD</cod=
e><span>&nbsp;</span>(ISO 8601) during the LLM normalisation step, regardle=
ss of how they appear in the source PDF.</p>
</blockquote>
<hr class=3D"code-line">
<h2 class=3D"code-line" id=3D"id-1.FSRPipelineScraping+Chunking=E2=80=93Des=
ign-Process2=E2=80=93Chunking&amp;VectorEmbedding">Process 2 =E2=80=93 Chun=
king &amp; Vector Embedding</h2>
<h3 class=3D"code-line" id=3D"id-1.FSRPipelineScraping+Chunking=E2=80=93Des=
ign-Purpose.1">Purpose</h3>
<p class=3D"code-line">Read FSR PDFs from the same volumes, parse and recur=
sively chunk the full document content, generate vector embeddings, and wri=
te chunk rows to a Delta table backed by Databricks Vector Search.</p>
<h3 class=3D"code-line" id=3D"id-1.FSRPipelineScraping+Chunking=E2=80=93Des=
ign-Input.1">Input</h3>
<h4 class=3D"code-line" id=3D"id-1.FSRPipelineScraping+Chunking=E2=80=93Des=
ign-SourceTable(Process1Output)">Source Table (Process 1 Output)</h4>
<p class=3D"code-line">Process 2 does<span>&nbsp;</span><strong>not</strong=
><span>&nbsp;</span>scan volumes directly. It reads from the Process 1 outp=
ut table and processes only rows where<span style=3D"color:#172b4d;"> </spa=
n><code><span style=3D"color:#172b4d;">chunk_status</span></code><span>&nbs=
p;</span>is<span>&nbsp;</span><code>pending</code>, or<span>&nbsp;</span><c=
ode>failed</code>.</p>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
 <table class=3D"wrapped confluenceTable">
  <thead class=3D"">
   <tr class=3D"">
    <th style=3D"text-align: left;" class=3D"confluenceTh">Table</th>
    <th style=3D"text-align: left;" class=3D"confluenceTh">Purpose</th>
   </tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody class=3D"">
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><code>vaid/vaiq/vaip.ai_sot_field_service_re=
port.biz_metadata_field_service_report</code></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Provides both the<span>&nbsp;</span><code>vo=
lume_path</code><span>&nbsp;</span>to locate each PDF and all metadata fiel=
ds for enrichment</td>
   </tr>
  </tbody>
 </table>
</div>
<p class=3D"code-line">The<span>&nbsp;</span><code>volume_path</code><span>=
&nbsp;</span>column on each row is used to load the physical PDF file from =
the volume. No separate volume scan or enrichment table is required =E2=80=
=94 all metadata is already available in the source table row.</p>
<blockquote class=3D"code-line">
 <p class=3D"code-line">Because Process 2 filters on<span style=3D"color:#1=
72b4d;"> <code>chunk_status</code></span><code><span>&nbsp;</span></code>st=
atus, re-running the job automatically picks up any new or previously faile=
d files without any additional configuration.</p>
</blockquote>
<h3 class=3D"code-line" id=3D"id-1.FSRPipelineScraping+Chunking=E2=80=93Des=
ign-ProcessingSteps(high-level).1">Processing Steps (high-level)</h3>
<ol class=3D"code-line">
 <li class=3D"code-line" data-uuid=3D"72cb9954-36e6-4ee7-96e5-01240ac49d45"=
>Read all rows from the Process 1 metadata table where&nbsp;<code><span sty=
le=3D"color:#172b4d;">chunk_status</span></code><span>&nbsp;</span>is<span>=
&nbsp;</span><code>pending</code>, or<span>&nbsp;</span><code>failed</code>=
</li>
 <li class=3D"code-line" data-uuid=3D"22e0fea3-4c3b-4291-b356-af36ea14239d"=
>For each row, use<span>&nbsp;</span><code>volume_path</code><span>&nbsp;</=
span>to load the PDF file from the Unity Catalog volume</li>
 <li class=3D"code-line" data-uuid=3D"051f36d4-a127-4b6e-9a09-98085c4b482e"=
>Extract full text from the PDF&nbsp;</li>
 <li class=3D"code-line" data-uuid=3D"07842806-ea18-4741-a906-49d5428f65db"=
>Recursively split text into chunks&nbsp;</li>
 <li class=3D"code-line" data-uuid=3D"922b76e3-a9cd-4580-b163-94e395455a57"=
>Denormalise metadata from the source row onto every chunk (no additional l=
ookup needed)</li>
 <li class=3D"code-line" data-uuid=3D"82f48173-42da-49c5-accf-3787af4c85a7"=
>Generate vector embeddings via LiteLLM (<code>azure-text-embedding-3-large=
-1</code>)</li>
 <li class=3D"code-line" data-uuid=3D"009f1dfa-edaa-467c-a3e3-6e0e203eff45"=
>Write chunk rows to the Delta chunk table</li>
 <li class=3D"code-line" data-uuid=3D"897f1aed-e43a-44b1-a05d-072da9de279a"=
><strong>On success:</strong><span>&nbsp;</span>update the source row =E2=
=80=94 set<span> <code><span style=3D"color:#172b4d;">chunk_status</span></=
code></span><code>&nbsp;=3D 'completed'</code></li>
 <li class=3D"code-line" data-uuid=3D"165173dd-12e3-4bd0-a767-1bee7c2b999a"=
><strong>On failure:</strong><span>&nbsp;</span>update the source row =E2=
=80=94 set&nbsp;<code><span style=3D"color:#172b4d;">chunk_status</span></c=
ode><code>&nbsp;=3D 'failed'</code>, populate<span>&nbsp;</span><code>error=
</code><span>&nbsp;</span>and<span>&nbsp;</span><code>error_reason</code>; =
the row will be retried on the next run</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"615930e8-a343-4ac3-abdd-a7684048ed13">Sync Delta table to=
 Databricks Vector Search index</li>
</ol>
<h3 class=3D"code-line" id=3D"id-1.FSRPipelineScraping+Chunking=E2=80=93Des=
ign-Output.1">Output</h3>
<h4 class=3D"code-line" id=3D"id-1.FSRPipelineScraping+Chunking=E2=80=93Des=
ign-OutputDeltaTable">Output Delta Table</h4>
<p class=3D"code-line"><code>vaid/vaiq/vaip.ai_std_con_field_service_report=
.vec_field_service_report</code></p>
<h4 class=3D"code-line" id=3D"id-1.FSRPipelineScraping+Chunking=E2=80=93Des=
ign-OutputVectorSearchIndex">Output Vector Search Index</h4>
<p class=3D"code-line"><code>vaid/vaiq/vaip.ai_std_con_field_service_report=
.vs_vec_field_service_report</code></p>
<p class=3D"code-line"><br></p>
<h4 class=3D"code-line" id=3D"id-1.FSRPipelineScraping+Chunking=E2=80=93Des=
ign-ChunkRowSchema">Chunk Row Schema</h4>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
 <table class=3D"wrapped confluenceTable">
  <thead class=3D"">
   <tr class=3D"">
    <th style=3D"text-align: left;" class=3D"confluenceTh">Column</th>
    <th style=3D"text-align: left;" class=3D"confluenceTh">Type</th>
    <th style=3D"text-align: left;" class=3D"confluenceTh">Description</th>
   </tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody class=3D"">
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><code>chunk_id</code></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">STRING NOT NULL</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><strong>Primary key.</strong><span>&nbsp;</s=
pan>Unique identifier per chunk =E2=80=94 generated as<span>&nbsp;</span><c=
ode>md5(pdf_name + "_" + chunk_index)</code></td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><code>pdf_name</code></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">STRING NOT NULL</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><span style=3D"color:#172b4d;">Human-readabl=
e PDF name</span></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><code>document_id</code></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">STRING NOT NULL</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">UUID filename stem of the source PDF</td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><code>page_number</code></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">INT</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Page number within the PDF where this chunk =
originates</td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><code>chunk_text</code></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">STRING NOT NULL</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Plain text content of the chunk</td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><code>esn</code></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">STRING</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Equipment Serial Number =E2=80=94 top-level =
column for Vector Search filtering (renamed from<span>&nbsp;</span><code>ge=
nerator_serial</code>)</td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><code>report_date</code></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">DATE</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Report issued date (kept for backward compat=
ibility)</td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><code>chunk_embedding</code></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">ARRAY&lt;DOUBLE&gt;</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Pre-computed embedding vector (3072 dimensio=
ns) =E2=80=94<span>&nbsp;</span><code>azure-text-embedding-3-large-1</code>=
</td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><code>metadata</code></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">STRING (JSON)</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">All contextual fields serialised as a JSON o=
bject =E2=80=94 see metadata fields below</td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><code>created_at</code></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">TIMESTAMP</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">When this chunk row was written</td>
   </tr>
  </tbody>
 </table>
</div>
<h4 class=3D"code-line" id=3D"id-1.FSRPipelineScraping+Chunking=E2=80=93Des=
ign-metadataJSONFields"><code>metadata</code><span>&nbsp;</span>JSON Fields=
</h4>
<p class=3D"code-line">All fields below are written into the<span>&nbsp;</s=
pan><code>metadata</code><span>&nbsp;</span>column as a single JSON object =
at chunking time, sourced directly from the metadata registry row.<span>&nb=
sp;</span><code>esn</code><span>&nbsp;</span>and<span>&nbsp;</span><code>pd=
f_name</code><span>&nbsp;</span>are duplicated here for self-contained cont=
ext when deserialising chunks on the client side.</p>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
 <table class=3D"wrapped confluenceTable">
  <thead class=3D"">
   <tr class=3D"">
    <th style=3D"text-align: left;" class=3D"confluenceTh">Field</th>
    <th style=3D"text-align: left;" class=3D"confluenceTh">Description</th>
   </tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody class=3D"">
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><code>pdf_name</code></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Source PDF file name / identifier</td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><code>page_number</code></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Page number within the PDF where this chunk =
originates</td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><code>title</code></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Report title</td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><code>customer</code></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Customer / site name</td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><code>esn</code></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Equipment Serial Number</td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><code>equipment_sys_id</code></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">System ID from IBAT</td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><code>equipment_type</code></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Equipment type (e.g. Generator, Gas Turbine)=
</td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><code>equipment_class_code</code></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Equipment sub-class / code</td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><code>event_type</code></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Event type (e.g. Call-Out, Inspection)</td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><code>ev_project_id</code></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Event Vision project ID</td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><code>ev_equipment_event_id</code></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Event Vision equipment event ID</td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><code>ofs_event_id</code></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">OFS event ID</td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><code>fsp_project_id</code></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">FSP project ID</td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><code>xxx_project_id</code></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Additional project ID (pipe-separated if mul=
tiple)</td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><code>fsr_number</code></td>
